    "text": "By Nick Bentley ,\n8 hours ago RALEIGH, N.C. (WNCN) — Members of the Raleigh Police Department and the Raleigh Fire Department are at the scene of a mulch fire that has closed a portion of a Raleigh road. According to Raleigh police, a section of Gresham Lake Road is closed between Gresham Hills Drive and Durant Overlook Road due to a large mulch fire on Wednesday afternoon. Read full article",
